WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:09.160
Well, let's say that in Colombia people ask way too much about very intimate things, very personal things sometimes.

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:17.500
Among those things, like how you survive, how your money comes in, and what you spend it on.

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:23.500
I generally don't talk about how I spend my money, since it's something personal.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:26.220
I also don't talk about how much my business brings in.

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:27.620
my business is myself

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.240
like I said, I've always worked on building myself up

00:00:32.579 --> 00:00:35.960
and well, I always say these are very personal things

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:38.740
I sometimes share with my mother

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:39.320
with my father

00:00:40.839 --> 00:00:43.520
some things, but it's something very personal to me

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:44.200
really

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:14.200
Yeah.
